CHURCH BOOKS (ሌሎች መጻሕፍት)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The ninety-four books on the ሌሎች መጻሕፍት shelf — the መልክእ hymns, the ድርሳናት, the
ገድላት, መጽሐፈ ሰዓታት, ሥርዓተ ቅዳሴ and the chant books of ቅዱስ ያሬድ — were scanned from
available PDF scans of the printed books by the Sinq maintainer, and are
released as open content under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0), the same terms as the
bundled scripture. The underlying texts are traditional Ethiopian Orthodox
Tewahedo liturgical material.

The text is reproduced as the scans carry it, with two disclosed exceptions:

  * The printer's tier marks ፪ማ፡ and ማ፡, which mark where a line of a stanza
    breaks, are rendered as those line breaks rather than as characters.
  * መጽሐፈ ሰዓታት is merged from three scanned copies. The bilingual copy is the
    spine; the Ge'ez-only copy restores the lines its scan dropped; the offices
    carried only by the ደብረ ዓባይ recension are labelled with that name.

  ማኅሌተ ጽጌ is shipped with its Amharic set against the Ge'ez verse by verse.
  ሰቆቃወ ድንግል's Amharic is one verse short of its Ge'ez and nothing in the text
  says which is missing, so it is appended whole under its own heading rather
  than interleaved — a positional pairing would be wrong after the gap.

  Built by tools/build_books.py, tools/merge_seatat.py and tools/merge_tsige.py.

